<title>ITALY: Gross yield rises at Italian BTP bond auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield rises at Italian BTP bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a ninth tranche of 1.5 trillion lire of 10-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (BTP) carrying an 8.75 percent coupon.</p>
<p>		   July 1, 2006    previous</p>
<p> Net Yield	  8.26 pct vs   8.16 pct</p>
<p> Gross Yield	9.44 pct vs   9.34 pct</p>
<p> Assigned price  96.90     vs  97.50</p>
<p> Bids		 4.106 trillion lire</p>
<p> Assigned	   1.500 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - The comparisons are with a previous auction on August 19 of a seventh tranche of 10-year BTPs.</p>
</text>
